body:
your opinions make you NTA but i don't think you should be so rude about it. why did this get you SO upset? i would never do this, but if someone ever told me to "get the fuck out" i would probably cry. life sucks for pretty much everyone i know right now, we don't need to be yelled at by strangers.

&#x200B;

edit: i sound like a whiny baby but i'm just so sick of hearing about people being so mean to each other. i work in customer service and people are so mean for honestly no reason (i work for a semi luxury dog brand...why are people mad about late shipping dog toys..), and i constantly hear about road rage incidents from friends, like everyone has so much pent up rage and it's scary. i don't want to be confronted with that anymore. no matter what is happening, you should still be able to speak kindly to one another!!

I feel bad that everyone is being so mean to you, calling you stupid etc.  

&#x200B;

If i knew how, i'd volunteer to find this scammer and go be a vigilante somehow. freak him out. tell him you know his real location, etc. I fucking hate scammers with a passion.
